---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Where to start reading the graph: starting points, hubs and unconnected entities

Usage: specforge explore [OPTIONS] [ENTITY]

Arguments:
  [ENTITY]
          Entity ID to explore from (omit to explore the whole project)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --kind <KIND>
          Only entities of this kind

      --depth <DEPTH>
          Hops from the entity (unbounded when omitted)

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
